{"id":"u-adee0448-447d-4c68-97cb-df8716070352","src":"community","title":"GZCLP: Tren Goblin","author":"Chris V.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/WvOTsc-gzclp-upperlower","desc":"The modified GZCLP Progression:\n\nTier 1: Use ~80-85% of a 5RM to start\n• 3 sets of 5 reps, if fail => \n• 3 sets of 4 reps, if fail => \n• 3 sets of 3 reps, if fail => rest 2-3 days and set new 5RM\n\nRate of Progression: (applied to both Tier 1 & 2)\nUpper Body Lifts: +2.5-5lbs per session\nLower Body Lifts: +5-10lbs per session\n\nTier 2: \n• 3 sets of 8 reps, if fail => \n• 3 sets of 6 reps, if fail => \n• 3 sets of 4 reps, if fail => restart at +10-20lbs heavier than last successful 3 sets of 8 reps\n\nTier 3: double progression method for whatever rep range is given:\nExample: 3 sets of 8-12 reps @ 100lbs\nWeek 1- 9,9,8 @ 100lbs\nWeek 2- 11,10,9 @ 100lbs\nWeek 3- 12,12,11 @ 100lbs\nWeek 4- 12,12,12 @ 100lbs => +5lbs\nWeek 5- 9,8,8 @ 105lbs","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength","Women's"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:08:42.240Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper 1: Bench Press","Lower 1: Squat","Upper 2: Close Grip Bench","Lower 2: Romanian Deadlift","Arm Day: (Optional)"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chin-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Inverted Row","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Upright Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]}]}]},{"ex":[{"ss":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Wrist Curls","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":7,"